<title>USA: Tupperware to buy back five mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Tupperware to buy back five mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tupperware Corp said Thursday it plans to buy back up to five million shares.</p>
<p>The shares repurchased are to be used for general corporate needs, it said. The buys are to take place from time to time.</p>
<p>The company currently has about 63.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
